  "@type": "DefinedTerm",
  "alternateName": "Spatial loss of habitat type from anthropogenic pressures below specified proportion of natural habitat extent",
  "description": "The extent of loss of the habitat type, resulting from anthropogenic pressures, does not exceed a specified proportion of the natural extent of the habitat type in the assessment area.\nMember States shall establish the maximum allowable extent of habitat loss as a proportion of the total natural extent of the habitat type, through cooperation at Union level, taking into account regional or subregional specificities.",
